  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Reads data chunk from the application. The first or subsequent file/directory info content chunk to be sent back to the UDS client will be composed by the application and copied into the provided by <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_diag_ara_diag_fbd60d.html\">ara::diag</a> Span with up to the requested Span size.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
